1299	16	\N	1	1	todo_user_onboarding	\N	project_todo.todo_user_onboarding	qweb	project_todo/data/todo_template.xml	primary	{"en_US": "<t t-name=\\"project_todo.todo_user_onboarding\\">\\n<h1>\\n    <span style=\\"font-size: 36px; color: #374151\\">Hey <t t-out=\\"object.name\\"/> &amp;#128075; <br/>\\n    Welcome to the To-do app! </span>\\n</h1>\\n<p>\\n    <span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\">\\n        Use it to manage your work, take notes on the go, and create tasks based on them.\\n    </span>\\n</p>\\n<p><br/></p>\\n<h3>Using the editor</h3>\\n<hr/>\\n<p>\\n    <span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\">This private to-do is for you to play around with.</span>\\n    <br/>\\n    <span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\">Ready to give it a spin?</span>\\n</p>\\n<p>\\n    <span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\">Try the following</span>\\n</p>\\n<ul class=\\"o_checklist\\">\\n    <li id=\\"checkId-948702291173\\">\\n        <span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\">Check this box to indicate it's done</span>\\n    </li>\\n    <li id=\\"checkId-140908257281\\">\\n        <span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\">Click anywhere, and just start typing</span>\\n    </li>\\n    <li id=\\"checkId-441216037148\\">\\n        <span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\">Press Ctrl+Z/⌘+Z to undo any change</span>\\n    </li>\\n    <li id=\\"checkId-980463482772\\">\\n        <span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\">\\n            Select text to\\n            <font style=\\"background-color: #017E84; color: white\\">Highlight</font>,\\n            <span style=\\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\\">strikethrough</span>\\n            or\\n            <span style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">style</span>\\n            <span style=\\"font-style: italic; text-decoration-line: underline;\\">it</span>\\n        </span>\\n    </li>\\n    <li id=\\"checkId-152369821198\\">\\n        <span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\">\\n            Below this list, try\\n            <span style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">commands</span>\\n            by\\n            <span style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">\\n                <font style=\\"color: #017E84\\">typing</font>\\n            </span>\\n            \\"<span style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">/</span>\\"\\n        </span>\\n    </li>\\n    <li class=\\"oe-nested\\" id=\\"checkId-947916154443\\">\\n        <ul class=\\"o_checklist\\">\\n            <li id=\\"checkId-1422510558483\\">\\n                <span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\">\\n                    Add a checklist\\n                    (/<span style=\\"font-style: italic;\\">checklist</span>)\\n                </span>\\n            </li>\\n            <li id=\\"checkId-109605733655\\">\\n                <span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\">\\n                    Add a separator\\n                    (/<span style=\\"font-style: italic;\\">separator</span>)\\n                </span>\\n            </li>\\n            <li id=\\"checkId-1518315885641\\">\\n                <span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\">\\n                    Use\\n                    /<span style=\\"font-style: italic;\\">heading</span>\\n                    to convert a text into a title\\n                </span>\\n            </li>\\n        </ul>\\n    </li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><br/></p>\\n\\n<h3>Who has access to what?</h3>\\n<hr/>\\n<p>\\n    <span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\">\\n        By default, to-dos are only visible to you. You can share them with other users by adding them as\\n        <span>\\n            <font style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\" class=\\"text-o-color-2\\">assignees</font>.\\n        </span>\\n    </span>\\n    <br/>\\n    <img class=\\"img-fluid d-none d-sm-block\\" src=\\"/project_todo/static/img/todo_access.png\\" alt=\\"todo-access\\"/>\\n</p>\\n<p><br/></p>\\n\\n<h3>Organize your to-dos however you want</h3>\\n<hr/>\\n<p>\\n    <span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\">\\n        Customize the stages from the\\n        <span style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">\\n            <font class=\\"text-o-color-2\\">Kanban view</font>\\n        </span>\\n        to reflect your preferred workflow.\\n    </span>\\n</p>\\n<p><br/></p>\\n\\n<h3 class=\\"fw-bolder\\">Enhance Your To-Dos with Shortcuts &amp;#9889;</h3>\\n<hr/>\\n<p>\\n    <span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\">\\n        Use these keywords in the title to streamline your to-dos:\\n    </span>\\n    <br/>\\n    <ul>\\n        <li>\\n            <span style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">\\n                <font class=\\"text-o-color-2\\">#tags:</font>\\n            </span>\\n            Add tags to categorize the to-do\\n        </li>\\n        <li>\\n            <span style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">\\n                <font class=\\"text-o-color-2\\">@user:</font>\\n            </span>\\n            Assign the to-do to a specific user\\n        </li>\\n        <li>\\n            <span style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">\\n                <font class=\\"text-o-color-2\\">!:</font>\\n            </span>\\n            Mark the to-do as medium priority\\n        </li>\\n        <li>\\n            <span style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">\\n                <font class=\\"text-o-color-2\\">!!:</font>\\n            </span>\\n            Mark the to-do as high priority\\n        </li>\\n        <li>\\n            <span style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">\\n                <font class=\\"text-o-color-2\\">!!!:</font>\\n            </span>\\n            Mark the to-do as urgent\\n        </li>\\n    </ul>\\n    <br/>\\n    <span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\">\\n        Ensure you follow the correct format and order. For example: Send invitations #event @Mitchell !\\n    </span>\\n</p>\\n<p><br/></p>\\n\\n<h3 class=\\"fw-bolder\\">Manage your to-dos and assigned tasks from a single place</h3>\\n<hr/>\\n<p>\\n    <span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\">\\n        Access your personal pipeline with your to-dos and assigned tasks by going to the Project app and clicking\\n        <span>\\n            <font style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\" class=\\"text-o-color-2\\">My Tasks</font>.\\n        </span>\\n    </span>\\n    <br/>\\n    <br/>\\n    <span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\">\\n        There, your to-dos are listed as\\n        <span style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">\\n            <font class=\\"text-o-color-2\\">private tasks.</font>\\n        </span>\\n        Any task you create privately will also be included in your to-dos. Essentially, they are interchangeable.\\n    </span>\\n</p>\\n<p><br/></p>\\n\\n<h3>Convert to-dos into tasks</h3>\\n<hr/>\\n<p>\\n    <span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\">\\n        If you want to assign your to-do to a specific project, open the ⚙️ menu and click\\n        <span>\\n            <font style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\" class=\\"text-o-color-2\\">Convert to Task</font>.\\n        </span>\\n        This action will make it visible to other users.\\n    </span>\\n    <br/>\\n    <img class=\\"img-fluid d-none d-sm-block\\" src=\\"/project_todo/static/img/convert_todo.png\\" alt=\\"convert-todo\\"/>\\n</p>\\n<p><br/></p>\\n\\n<h3>Create to-dos from anywhere</h3>\\n<hr/>\\n<p>\\n    <span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\">\\n        Wherever you are, use the magic keyboard shortcut to add yourself a reminder &amp;#128161;\\n    </span>\\n    <br/>\\n    <ul>\\n        <li>\\n            <span style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">\\n                <font class=\\"text-o-color-2\\">Alt + Shift + T</font>\\n            </span>\\n            (Windows/Linux)\\n        </li>\\n        <li>\\n            <span style=\\"font-weight: bolder;\\">\\n                <font class=\\"text-o-color-2\\">Ctrl + Shift + T</font>\\n            </span>\\n            (MacOs)\\n        </li>\\n    </ul>\\n</p>\\n    </t>"}	<?xml version="1.0"?>\n<t t-name="project_todo.todo_user_onboarding">\n<h1>\n    <span style="font-size: 36px; color: #374151">Hey <t t-out="object.name"/> &amp;#128075; <br/>\n    Welcome to the To-do app! </span>\n</h1>\n<p>\n    <span style="font-size: 14px;">\n        Use it to manage your work, take notes on the go, and create tasks based on them.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<h3>Using the editor</h3>\n<hr/>\n<p>\n    <span style="font-size: 14px;">This private to-do is for you to play around with.</span>\n    <br/>\n    <span style="font-size: 14px;">Ready to give it a spin?</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n    <span style="font-size: 14px;">Try the following</span>\n</p>\n<ul class="o_checklist">\n    <li id="checkId-948702291173">\n        <span style="font-size: 14px;">Check this box to indicate it's done</span>\n    </li>\n    <li id="checkId-140908257281">\n        <span style="font-size: 14px;">Click anywhere, and just start typing</span>\n    </li>\n    <li id="checkId-441216037148">\n        <span style="font-size: 14px;">Press Ctrl+Z/⌘+Z to undo any change</span>\n    </li>\n    <li id="checkId-980463482772">\n        <span style="font-size: 14px;">\n            Select text to\n            <font style="background-color: #017E84; color: white">Highlight</font>,\n            <span style="text-decoration-line: line-through;">strikethrough</span>\n            or\n            <span style="font-weight: bolder;">style</span>\n            <span style="font-style: italic; text-decoration-line: underline;">it</span>\n        </span>\n    </li>\n    <li id="checkId-152369821198">\n        <span style="font-size: 14px;">\n            Below this list, try\n            <span style="font-weight: bolder;">commands</span>\n            by\n            <span style="font-weight: bolder;">\n                <font style="color: #017E84">typing</font>\n            </span>\n            "<span style="font-weight: bolder;">/</span>"\n        </span>\n    </li>\n    <li class="oe-nested" id="checkId-947916154443">\n        <ul class="o_checklist">\n            <li id="checkId-1422510558483">\n                <span style="font-size: 14px;">\n                    Add a checklist\n                    (/<span style="font-style: italic;">checklist</span>)\n                </span>\n            </li>\n            <li id="checkId-109605733655">\n                <span style="font-size: 14px;">\n                    Add a separator\n                    (/<span style="font-style: italic;">separator</span>)\n                </span>\n            </li>\n            <li id="checkId-1518315885641">\n                <span style="font-size: 14px;">\n                    Use\n                    /<span style="font-style: italic;">heading</span>\n                    to convert a text into a title\n                </span>\n            </li>\n        </ul>\n    </li>\n</ul>\n<p><br/></p>\n\n<h3>Who has access to what?</h3>\n<hr/>\n<p>\n    <span style="font-size: 14px;">\n        By default, to-dos are only visible to you. You can share them with other users by adding them as\n        <span>\n            <font style="font-weight: bolder;" class="text-o-color-2">assignees</font>.\n        </span>\n    </span>\n    <br/>\n    <img class="img-fluid d-none d-sm-block" src="/project_todo/static/img/todo_access.png" alt="todo-access"/>\n</p>\n<p><br/></p>\n\n<h3>Organize your to-dos however you want</h3>\n<hr/>\n<p>\n    <span style="font-size: 14px;">\n        Customize the stages from the\n        <span style="font-weight: bolder;">\n            <font class="text-o-color-2">Kanban view</font>\n        </span>\n        to reflect your preferred workflow.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p><br/></p>\n\n<h3 class="fw-bolder">Enhance Your To-Dos with Shortcuts &amp;#9889;</h3>\n<hr/>\n<p>\n    <span style="font-size: 14px;">\n        Use these keywords in the title to streamline your to-dos:\n    </span>\n    <br/>\n    <ul>\n        <li>\n            <span style="font-weight: bolder;">\n                <font class="text-o-color-2">#tags:</font>\n            </span>\n            Add tags to categorize the to-do\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <span style="font-weight: bolder;">\n                <font class="text-o-color-2">@user:</font>\n            </span>\n            Assign the to-do to a specific user\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <span style="font-weight: bolder;">\n                <font class="text-o-color-2">!:</font>\n            </span>\n            Mark the to-do as medium priority\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <span style="font-weight: bolder;">\n                <font class="text-o-color-2">!!:</font>\n            </span>\n            Mark the to-do as high priority\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <span style="font-weight: bolder;">\n                <font class="text-o-color-2">!!!:</font>\n            </span>\n            Mark the to-do as urgent\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n    <br/>\n    <span style="font-size: 14px;">\n        Ensure you follow the correct format and order. For example: Send invitations #event @Mitchell !\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p><br/></p>\n\n<h3 class="fw-bolder">Manage your to-dos and assigned tasks from a single place</h3>\n<hr/>\n<p>\n    <span style="font-size: 14px;">\n        Access your personal pipeline with your to-dos and assigned tasks by going to the Project app and clicking\n        <span>\n            <font style="font-weight: bolder;" class="text-o-color-2">My Tasks</font>.\n        </span>\n    </span>\n    <br/>\n    <br/>\n    <span style="font-size: 14px;">\n        There, your to-dos are listed as\n        <span style="font-weight: bolder;">\n            <font class="text-o-color-2">private tasks.</font>\n        </span>\n        Any task you create privately will also be included in your to-dos. Essentially, they are interchangeable.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p><br/></p>\n\n<h3>Convert to-dos into tasks</h3>\n<hr/>\n<p>\n    <span style="font-size: 14px;">\n        If you want to assign your to-do to a specific project, open the ⚙️ menu and click\n        <span>\n            <font style="font-weight: bolder;" class="text-o-color-2">Convert to Task</font>.\n        </span>\n        This action will make it visible to other users.\n    </span>\n    <br/>\n    <img class="img-fluid d-none d-sm-block" src="/project_todo/static/img/convert_todo.png" alt="convert-todo"/>\n</p>\n<p><br/></p>\n\n<h3>Create to-dos from anywhere</h3>\n<hr/>\n<p>\n    <span style="font-size: 14px;">\n        Wherever you are, use the magic keyboard shortcut to add yourself a reminder &amp;#128161;\n    </span>\n    <br/>\n    <ul>\n        <li>\n            <span style="font-weight: bolder;">\n                <font class="text-o-color-2">Alt + Shift + T</font>\n            </span>\n            (Windows/Linux)\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <span style="font-weight: bolder;">\n                <font class="text-o-color-2">Ctrl + Shift + T</font>\n            </span>\n            (MacOs)\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n</p>\n    </t>\n\n	f	t	2026-09-05 15:59:53.744877	2026-09-05 15:59:53.744877	f
